Package: easyNIS
Title: Tidy Workflows for the National Inpatient Sample
Version: 0.2.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Muhammad", "Saad", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "msaadasif.md@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-1792-2357")),
    person("Ali", role = "aut"))
Description: Pipe-friendly tools for working with Healthcare Cost and
    Utilization Project National Inpatient Sample Parquet files. Opens annual
    files lazily, flags diagnosis and procedure codes, looks up CCSR codes,
    calculates comorbidity scores, prepares survey designs, supports
    propensity-based reweighting, applies HCUP labels, and adjusts charges for
    inflation. ICD-9 and NIS 2023 support are experimental.
